        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning Two-Bed Apartment with Sea Views Malahide Marina Village\n\n\nA superb two-bedroom apartment available to rent. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this bright and well-maintained apartment benefits from beautiful sea views and newly fitted bathrooms, offering comfortable and modern living in a fantastic coastal setting.\n\nIdeally located within easy reach of Malahide village, residents can enjoy a wonderful selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and local amenities, with coastline and scenic walks right on your doorstep. Excellent transport links also provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\n\nA fantastic opportunity to rent a quality apartment in one of Malahide`s most desirable locations.\n\n"
